        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.238,
            0.376,
            0.254
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "一、选择题（每题2分，共20分）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.258,
            0.49,
            0.273
          ],
          "content": "1、关于肌动蛋白的以下描述，那种描述是错误的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.278,
            0.614,
            0.354
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "A. 肌动蛋白是微丝的基础蛋白质。\nB. F 肌动蛋白的聚合过程不需能量。\nC. 肌动蛋白上有肌球蛋白结合位点，但无二价阳离子的结合位点。\nD. G 肌动蛋白与 F 肌动蛋白可互相转变。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.379,
            0.448,
            0.394
          ],
          "content": "2、在真核细胞中，哪一种 RNA 是最丰富的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.4,
            0.174,
            0.414
          ],
          "content": "A. snRNA"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.215,
            0.4,
            0.289,
            0.414
          ],
          "content": "B. mRNA"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.33,
            0.4,
            0.395,
            0.414
          ],
          "content": "C. tRNA"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.437,
            0.4,
            0.503,
            0.414
          ],
          "content": "D. rRNA"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.439,
            0.773,
            0.455
          ],
          "content": "3、要探知某组织或细胞内某一蛋白质的表达水平，可以通过以下那种实验方法来实现？"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.46,
            0.211,
            0.474
          ],
          "content": "A. Western blot"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.251,
            0.46,
            0.372,
            0.474
          ],
          "content": "B. Northern blot"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.421,
            0.46,
            0.542,
            0.474
          ],
          "content": "C. Southern blot"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.581,
            0.46,
            0.717,
            0.474
          ],
          "content": "D. 原位分子杂交"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.5,
            0.504,
            0.515
          ],
          "content": "4、指导蛋白质转运到叶绿体上的氨基酸序列被称为:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.52,
            0.183,
            0.535
          ],
          "content": "A. 转运肽"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.224,
            0.52,
            0.309,
            0.535
          ],
          "content": "B. 信号肽"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.36,
            0.52,
            0.428,
            0.535
          ],
          "content": "C. 导肽"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.469,
            0.52,
            0.555,
            0.535
          ],
          "content": "D. 新生肽"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.56,
            0.416,
            0.575
          ],
          "content": "5、高尔基体对蛋白质的分选信号存在于:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.58,
            0.217,
            0.595
          ],
          "content": "A. 蛋白质本身"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.259,
            0.58,
            0.362,
            0.595
          ],
          "content": "B. 糖基侧链"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.404,
            0.58,
            0.524,
            0.595
          ],
          "content": "C. 乙酰基侧链"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.574,
            0.58,
            0.696,
            0.595
          ],
          "content": "D. 脂肪酸侧链"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.62,
            0.432,
            0.636
          ],
          "content": "6、在核小体之间起连接作用的组蛋白应为:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.641,
            0.15,
            0.655
          ],
          "content": "A. H1"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.219,
            0.642,
            0.272,
            0.655
          ],
          "content": "B. H2"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.341,
            0.642,
            0.394,
            0.655
          ],
          "content": "C. H3"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.464,
            0.642,
            0.517,
            0.655
          ],
          "content": "D. H4"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.68,
            0.308,
            0.696
          ],
          "content": "7、所有的原核细胞都具有:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.7,
            0.248,
            0.716
          ],
          "content": "A. 核糖体和线粒体"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.272,
            0.701,
            0.424,
            0.716
          ],
          "content": "B. 细胞膜和核糖体"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.457,
            0.701,
            0.607,
            0.716
          ],
          "content": "C. 内质网和中心体"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.641,
            0.701,
            0.793,
            0.716
          ],
          "content": "D. 细胞膜和叶绿体"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.741,
            0.59,
            0.757
          ],
          "content": "8、要探查 DNA 与蛋白质的相互作用，可以用以下哪一种方法？"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.761,
            0.235,
            0.776
          ],
          "content": "A、甘油梯度离心"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.276,
            0.762,
            0.38,
            0.776
          ],
          "content": "B、凝胶过滤"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.422,
            0.762,
            0.559,
            0.776
          ],
          "content": "C、凝胶延滞实验"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.601,
            0.762,
            0.718,
            0.776
          ],
          "content": "D、SDS-PAGE"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.801,
            0.415,
            0.817
          ],
          "content": "9、细胞坏死与细胞凋亡最主要的区别是:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.822,
            0.213,
            0.837
          ],
          "content": "A. 细胞核肿胀"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.258,
            0.822,
            0.375,
            0.837
          ],
          "content": "B. 内质网扩张"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.421,
            0.822,
            0.519,
            0.837
          ],
          "content": "C. 细胞变形"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.578,
            0.822,
            0.731,
            0.837
          ],
          "content": "D. 是否有炎症反应"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.862,
            0.444,
            0.878
          ],
          "content": "10、下列哪一项生化过程不在线粒体中进行？"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.883,
            0.217,
            0.897
          ],
          "content": "A. 三羧酸循环"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.266,
            0.883,
            0.388,
            0.897
          ],
          "content": "B. 氧化磷酸化"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.439,
            0.883,
            0.522,
            0.897
          ],
          "content": "C. β-氧化"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.564,
            0.883,
            0.65,
            0.897
          ],
          "content": "D. 糖酵解"
        },
        {
